Pillow, MIT-CMU (source derivative)
-----------------------------------

src/pillow.rs ports Pillow 12.3.0's resampler (src/libImaging/Resample.c,
and Image.resize in src/PIL/Image.py) and its conversions to 8-bit grey
(src/libImaging/Convert.c). The license is in src/LICENSE-pillow.

